+Native white/navy/blue chrome with restrained red/blue shield branding; owner-drawn selected tabs with close targets and focus indication; navigation/address/bookmark/privacy controls; compact menu and Home/Bookmarks/Settings sidebar; native branded homepage with submit-only search and editable shortcuts; per-profile atomic saved-site persistence; shared styling for search/privacy/library/lab forms; actual privacy mode/pause/count indication and synchronized pause controls. History is intentionally omitted, not represented by a fake button. Profile name is informational; switching remains the existing CLI workflow.
