+The homepage uses native WinForms controls over the existing about:blank browser tab. It introduces no privileged JS bridge, remote assets or fingerprint modifications. The existing Chromium navigation, popup ownership, TLS denial and host-disposal paths remain intact. The Security Lab service, mock-only authorization and sanitization code are unchanged. See docs/ui-redesign.md for behavior and trade-offs.
